# Advanced 9-ball three-rail bank: send the legal 8 bottom-right-top into the center-left pocket.
# Instructional source: https://drdavepoolinfo.com/resource_files/trcd/CueTimes%20PDFs/209%20Safety%20Second.pdf
# Validation contract: cue contacts 8 first; 8 contacts bottom, right, and top cushions in order before center-left capture.
table brunswick_gc4_9ft
game nine_ball
ball cue at (0.5040, 6.3940)
ball eight at (1.0000, 5.0000)
ball nine at (0.5000, 7.0000)
cue_strike(default).mass_ratio(1.0).energy_loss(0.1)
trace(max_events: 40)
shot(cue).heading(160.40deg).speed(200ips).tip(side: 0.0R, height: 0.0R).using(default)
